WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,860
I'll get you some

2
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:08,860
We don’t have much supplies either.

3
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:12,470
There won’t be a next time. Thank you. Thank you.

4
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,470
girls

5
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:16,660
Sister Yun Xi wants me to tell you that she shouldn’t be tied up.

6
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,660
How can we help?

7
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,660
She said she had a child and I softened her heart.

8
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,660
I remember the way my mother used to take me when she was a child

9
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,660
also for me

10
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,660
Suffered a lot

11
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,660
It's okay, Sister Yun Xi

12
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:29,160
You are just too kind

13
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,160
Mom, I'm not thirsty anymore

14
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,160
You drink it

15
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:33,930
Mom is not thirsty either

16
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:36,120
Leave these for Xiaoxuan to drink at night

17
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,690
Mom, will Dad come back?

18
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:52,360
Now the only one who can protect Xiaoxuan is me.

19
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,360
what must be done

20
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:54,360
Who dares to touch my daughter

21
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,360
I'll fight him
